            "review_title": "Review at Spice Temple - Crescent Mall",
            "review_text": "Minh C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam25 contributions\n0\nSpice temple for young kids too\nDec 2023 • Family\nWe love the free appetizer :)\n\nThe food at Spice temple was very good and accomdate for young kids. They enjoyed the pork belly, pad Thai. Seabass with basil sauce is a Must Try (yummy with sticky rice).\n\nDessert was also a good palate, super nice ending of the meal.\n\nWe had a good time, good food and great services.\nRead more\nWritten January 1, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
