            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nWORST THAI FOOD IN HCMC\nNov 2022 • Friends\nThe worst Thai food I have ever had!!!\nTom yum soup was colourful but tasteless. The so called Stir Fry Morning Glory with bean sauce was full of beans and stalk but no leaves. The worst was the Fried Seabass with Mango Salad. The salad was bland and totally dry . Service was really bad. They serve a friends drink to the wrong table and after a while I asked why drink was not served the waitress went to the table that she served wrongly to and took the drink back and wanted to serve to us. Obviously we refused to accept that. Please refer to the photographs.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2022",
