            "review_text": "Stay with Johnson\nTaipei, Taiwan408 contributions\n1\nGenuine Thai Tastes in Saigon\nSep 2020\nAfter the second visit to Spice Temple, I’ve totally fallen in love with their authentic Thai cuisines.\n\nMy first try was early 2019 to their Dist 2 branch. Because I was having a gathering meal that time, I tasted several of their dishes and definitely they grabbed my attention (hoping for a re-visit).\n\nThen this year when I learnt that their Dist 1 store ceased operation... I felt sad. But thankfully they opened a new restaurant in The Crescent Mall (Dist 7). Upon knowing this news, I went back and fulfilled my longtime wish.\n\nAlthough their entry level of spiciness is already a bit challenging, yet I know they don’t alter the flavors to comply with local tastes. Therefore, even I haven’t had a chance to visit Thailand yet, I get to taste the genuine Thai in Saigon.\n\nWhat’s beautifully captured on their menu, they can surely present the exact same food with enchanting flavors. A feast to the eyes & stomach, without a doubt. I highly recommend Spice Temple :)\n\n[ IG/Medium/FB Page @chicve02 ]\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 25, 2020",
